---
import SeminaireLayout from '../layouts/SeminaireLayout.astro';

const smImg = (file: string) => `/assets/images/seminaire/${encodeURIComponent(file)}`;

/** Non-hero assets in public/assets/images/seminaire (hero stays seminaire-hero.jpg). */
const img = {
  guinguette: 'etoileblanche58.jpg',
  restaurant: 'DSCF4780.JPG',
  roomWide: 'ToileBlanche_MegWhitePhotography_15.jpg',
  roomDetail: 'B502F29D-C840-4732-9401-7E5291B05A1E.jpeg',
  toileblanche: 'DSCF6159 2.JPG',
  landscape: 'IMG_7629.jpg',
} as const;
---

<SeminaireLayout>

  <!-- ─── Section 01: The Premise ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--premise">

    <div class="sm-hero-image">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/seminaire/seminaire-hero.jpg"
        alt="Mas de l'Artiste, Toile Blanche"
        loading="eager"
        class="sm-img"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="sm-container">
      <p class="sm-eyebrow">Toile Blanche, Saint-Paul-de-Vence</p>

      <h1 class="sm-h1">Le Séminaire</h1>

      <p class="sm-subtitle">A working retreat for leadership groups.<br />November through March. Weekdays only.</p>

      <div class="sm-body-text">
        <p>The best decisions a team ever makes rarely happen in a meeting room. They happen at dinner, on a walk, in the space between one conversation and the next.</p>

        <p>Le Séminaire is two to four nights in Provence, off-season, with the people who matter most to what you are building. Up to sixteen people, one suite each. Working sessions in a two-hundred-year-old mas that is itself part of a declared artwork. All meals at Toile Blanche. Weekdays only.</p>

        <p>No flip charts. No team-building exercises. No hotel conference wing. Just a small group of people, a remarkable place, and enough time to think properly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 02: How the Days Work ────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--days">
    <div class="sm-container">

      <p class="sm-section-label">How the days work</p>
      <h2 class="sm-h2">The rhythm</h2>

      <div class="sm-body-text">
        <p>Mornings belong to the work. The group moves to the working room, a fifty-square-metre ground floor of a two-hundred-year-old mas, configured around a long table with natural light on both sides. Coffee and croissants are already there.</p>

        <p>The room is not a meeting room. It is a mas, with stone walls, original beams, and an artwork from the Toile Blanche collection on the wall. The environment is not incidental to the thinking. It is part of it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-inline-image">
        <img
          src={smImg(img.guinguette)}
          alt="La Guinguette"
          loading="lazy"
          class="sm-img"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="sm-body-text">
        <p>Lunch is at La Guinguette. Sharing plates, Provençal produce, the particular pleasure of stepping outside in the middle of a working day.</p>

        <p>Afternoons are unstructured. The village, the foundations, the grounds, a walk. The conversations that started at the table tend to continue here.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-inline-image">
        <img
          src={smImg(img.restaurant)}
          alt="Le Restaurant"
          loading="lazy"
          class="sm-img"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="sm-body-text">
        <p>In the evening, a drink with the Leroy Brothers before dinner, if the group wishes. Then dinner at Le Restaurant.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-day-rhythm">
        <p>Morning, Mas de l'Artiste working room</p>
        <p>Midday, La Guinguette</p>
        <p>Afternoon, Toile Blanche</p>
        <p>Evening, Le Restaurant</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 03: The Spaces ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--spaces">
    <div class="sm-container">

      <p class="sm-section-label">Where you work. Where you stay.</p>

      <div class="sm-subsection">
        <div class="sm-inline-image sm-inline-image--flush-top">
          <img
            src={smImg(img.roomWide)}
            alt="Mas de l'Artiste working room"
            loading="lazy"
            class="sm-img"
          />
        </div>

        <p class="sm-subsection-label">The working room</p>
        <h2 class="sm-h2">Mas de l'Artiste</h2>

        <div class="sm-body-text">
          <p>The working room is the ground floor of Mas de l'Artiste, the oldest building at Toile Blanche. Two centuries of stone walls, original beams, and a fireplace. Fifty square metres around a single long table that seats up to sixteen.</p>

          <p>Natural light from full-height windows. An artwork from the permanent collection. A separate WC. Coffee and breakfast provisions from the kitchenette. Nothing that looks like a conference room.</p>

          <p>The Leroy Brothers' studios are steps away. The proximity is available, not imposed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sm-inline-image">
          <img
            src={smImg(img.roomDetail)}
            alt="Working room detail"
            loading="lazy"
            class="sm-img"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-subsection">
        <div class="sm-inline-image sm-inline-image--flush-top">
          <img
            src={smImg(img.toileblanche)}
            alt="Toile Blanche"
            loading="lazy"
            class="sm-img"
          />
        </div>

        <p class="sm-subsection-label">The accommodation</p>
        <h2 class="sm-h2">Toile Blanche</h2>

        <div class="sm-body-text">
          <p>Twenty-two suites across seven buildings on a property declared a conceptual artwork in 2026 by the Leroy Brothers, the three artists who own and run it. One suite per person. Each suite is different. All have been designed to feel like a home rather than a hotel room.</p>

          <p>Two restaurants. The village of Saint-Paul-de-Vence ten minutes on foot. The foundations within reach.</p>

          <p>
            <a href="https://www.toileblanche.com" class="sm-inline-link">Full details at toileblanche.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 04: The Details ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--details">
    <div class="sm-container">

      <p class="sm-section-label">What is included</p>

      <div class="sm-includes">
        <p>One suite per person throughout.</p>
        <p>Complimentary breakfast daily at Toile Blanche.</p>
        <p>Lunch daily at La Guinguette.</p>
        <p>Dinner daily at Le Restaurant.</p>
        <p>The working room in Mas de l'Artiste, full days.</p>
        <p>Coffee, water, and morning provisions in the room.</p>
        <p>A pre-dinner drink with the Leroy Brothers, on the first evening, if you wish.</p>
        <p>Basic AV: screen, HDMI connection, wifi throughout.</p>
        <p>Concierge available for individual needs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sm-rates-block">
        <p class="sm-section-label">Rates</p>
        <p class="sm-rate-line">From €690 per person per night, all-inclusive</p>

        <div class="sm-rates-supporting">
          <p>Two to four nights. Weekdays only.</p>
          <p>Eight to sixteen people. One suite per person.</p>
          <p>November through March.</p>
          <p>Direct enquiry only.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="mailto:seminaire@toileblanche.com" class="sm-cta">
          Write to us about Le Séminaire
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 05: Closing ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="sm-section sm-section--closing">

    <div class="sm-closing-image">
      <img
        src={smImg(img.landscape)}
        alt="Provence, off-season"
        loading="lazy"
        class="sm-img"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="sm-container sm-container--closing">
      <div class="sm-closing-text">
        <p>Le Séminaire is not for every group. It is for the ones who understand that where you think changes what you think.</p>

        <p>If that is your team, write to us. We begin with a conversation about what you are working on and what you need the days to produce. Everything else follows from there.</p>

        <a href="mailto:seminaire@toileblanche.com" class="sm-closing-email">
          seminaire@toileblanche.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

</SeminaireLayout>

<style>
  /* ─── Seminaire page layout ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  /* Shared container: max 680px, centred, horizontal padding on mobile */
  .sm-container {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding-left: var(--space-section-x);
    padding-right: var(--space-section-x);
  }

  /* Sections — consistent 80px top/bottom throughout */
  .sm-section {
    padding-top: var(--space-10);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  /* Premise starts with hero image above the container, no top padding needed */
  .sm-section--premise {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  /* Closing starts with a full-width image outside the container */
  .sm-section--closing {
    padding-top: 0;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  /* ─── Images ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  /* Full-content-column images */
  .sm-hero-image {
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .sm-inline-image {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .sm-inline-image--flush-top {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .sm-img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    object-fit: cover;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-warm);
  }

  .sm-hero-image .sm-img {
    max-height: 60vh;
  }

  /* ─── Typography ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  /* Eyebrow / small-caps labels */
  .sm-eyebrow,
  .sm-section-label,
  .sm-subsection-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    color: var(--color-stone-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
  }

  .sm-section-label {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* H1: Heebo (same stack as La Vie Ici / L'Hiver); size unchanged from original seminaire scale */
  .sm-h1 {
    font-family: 'Heebo', var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wider);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    color: var(--color-ink-deep);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* H2: Gilda Display, 1.5 line-height */
  .sm-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-ink-deep);
    margin: var(--space-1) 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  /* Subtitle: Gilda Display italic */
  .sm-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-stone);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  /* Body text */
  .sm-body-text p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  /* ─── Day rhythm block ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .sm-day-rhythm {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .sm-day-rhythm p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-stone);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .sm-subsection {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .sm-subsection:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sm-subsection-label {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  /* Inline link */
  .sm-inline-link {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-terracotta-30);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .sm-inline-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-terracotta-deep);
  }

  /* ─── Details section ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  /* Includes: plain stacked lines, no markers */
  .sm-includes {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .sm-includes p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-faint);
  }

  .sm-includes p:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* Rates block: shaded olive tint */
  .sm-rates-block {
    background-color: rgba(173, 180, 160, 0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }

  .sm-rate-line {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    color: var(--color-ink-deep);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .sm-rates-supporting {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .sm-rates-supporting p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-stone);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-1);
  }

  /* CTA button */
  .sm-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-normal);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-bg);
    background-color: #ac6b53;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .sm-cta:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-terracotta-deep);
  }

  /* ─── Closing section ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

  .sm-closing-image {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding-left: var(--space-section-x);
    padding-right: var(--space-section-x);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .sm-container--closing {
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-section-y);
  }

  .sm-closing-text p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .sm-closing-email {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .sm-closing-email:hover {
    color: var(--color-terracotta-deep);
  }
</style>
